// LightmappedReflective_DX90 (lightmappedreflective_ps20b /
// lightmappedreflective_vs20): the reflection and refraction textures
// perturbed by the normal map, blended by the Fresnel term of the tangent-space
// eye vector (brush tangents), with the base texture times the bumped
// lightmaps (uv1 stepped by uv2) and the envmap mask.
